DeliveryManagementSystem "1" *-- "1" UserDirectory
DeliveryManagementSystem "1" *-- "1" StaffRoster
DeliveryManagementSystem "1" *-- "1" DeliveryRegistry
DeliveryManagementSystem --> PaymentGateway : uses
UserDirectory "1" *-- "*" User : manages
User <|-- Client
User <|-- OfficeStaff
User <|-- DeliveryStaff
OfficeStaff <|-- BusinessOwner
DeliveryRequest "*" --> "1" Client : logged for
DeliveryRequest "*" --> "0..1" OfficeStaff : quoted by
DeliveryRequest "*" --> "0..1" DeliveryStaff : assigned to
DeliveryRequest "1" *-- "1" Recipient : received by
DeliveryRequest "1" *-- "2" Address : pickup, drop-off
DeliveryRequest "1" *-- "1..10" Parcel : contains
DeliveryRequest "1" *-- "1..*" StatusChange : history
DeliveryRequest "1" *-- "*" CustodyRecord : custody
DeliveryRequest "1" *-- "0..1" Quote : contains
DeliveryRequest "1" *-- "0..1" Payment : processed via
DeliveryRequest "1" o-- "*" DeliveryObserver : notifies
DeliveryObserver <|.. NotificationService
NotificationService ..> Client : emails
NotificationService ..> Recipient : sends SMS
DeliveryRegistry "1" o-- "*" DeliveryRequest : stores
DeliveryRegistry "*" --> "1" ServiceArea : validates addresses
DeliveryRegistry --> "2" PricingStrategy : prices with
PricingStrategy <|-- StandardPricing
PricingStrategy <|-- ExpressPricing
StaffRoster "1" o-- "*" StaffAvailability : contains
StaffRoster "1" --> "*" DeliveryStaff : schedules
StaffAvailability "*" --> "1" DeliveryStaff : belongs to
Payment <|-- CashOnDelivery
Payment <|-- OnlinePayment
Payment ..> Invoice : issues
OnlinePayment ..> PaymentGateway : charges via
PaymentGateway <|.. SimulatedPaymentGateway
PaymentGateway ..> ChargeResult : returns
